    {
      "source": "Create a new instance of the <a href=\"MapDataSourceLookup.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.jdbc.datasource.lookup\"><code>MapDataSourceLookup</code></a> class.",
      "translation": "创建 `<a href=\"MapDataSourceLookup.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.jdbc.datasource.lookup\"><code>MapDataSourceLookup</code></a>` 类的新实例。",
      "count": 6
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>dataSourceName</code> - the name under which the supplied <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/javax/sql/DataSource.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.sql\"><code>DataSource</code></a> is to be added",
      "translation": "<code>dataSourceName</code> - 要添加的提供的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/javax/sql/DataSource.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.sql\"><code>DataSource</code></a> 的名称",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Useful for testing environments or applications that need to match arbitrary\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> names to target <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/javax/sql/DataSource.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.sql\"><code>DataSource</code></a> objects.",
      "translation": "适用于测试环境或需要匹配任意 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> 名称以定位 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/javax/sql/DataSource.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.sql\"><code>DataSource</code></a> 对象的应用程序。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The returned <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> is <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collections.html#unmodifiableMap(java.util.Map)\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>unmodifiable</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>是<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collections.html#unmodifiableMap(java.util.Map)\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>unmodifiable</code></a>的。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "If the supplied <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> is <code>null</code>, then this method\ncall effectively has no effect.",
      "translation": "如果提供的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>为<code>null</code>，则此方法调用实际上没有任何效果。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Add the supplied <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/javax/sql/DataSource.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.sql\"><code>DataSource</code></a> to the map of <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/javax/sql/DataSource.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.sql\"><code>DataSources</code></a>\nmaintained by this object.",
      "translation": "将提供的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/javax/sql/DataSource.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.sql\"><code>DataSource</code></a> 添加到由该对象维护的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/javax/sql/DataSource.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.sql\"><code>DataSources</code></a> 映射中。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Retrieve the DataSource identified by the given name.",
      "translation": "获取给定名称的 DataSource。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>dataSources</code> - the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> of <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/javax/sql/DataSource.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.sql\"><code>DataSources</code></a>; the keys\nare <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Strings</code></a>, the values are actual <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/javax/sql/DataSource.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.sql\"><code>DataSource</code></a> instances.",
      "translation": "<code>dataSources</code> - <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> 类型的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/javax/sql/DataSource.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.sql\"><code>DataSources</code></a>；键为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Strings</code></a>，值为实际的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/javax/sql/DataSource.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.sql\"><code>DataSource</code></a> 实例。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>dataSource</code> - the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/javax/sql/DataSource.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.sql\"><code>DataSource</code></a> to be added",
      "translation": "<code>dataSource</code> - 要添加的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/javax/sql/DataSource.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.sql\"><code>DataSource</code></a>",
